This project is derived from FangjiW/BBMOCBS-approx:
https://github.com/FangjiW/BBMOCBS-approx
Upstream snapshot: 09d4b7079a3446c61bd82d3be5a5418b0e4f7e53 (master).

The original source and example files were obtained from that snapshot.
The upstream LICENSE (GNU General Public License, version 3) is retained.
The derivative additions are distributed under the same license.

Changes made for BB-MO-CBS-apex-H1:
- Added BB-MO-CBS-pex-H, exact constrained scalar search, conflict matching,
  labeled lower bounds, transactional bound pruning and cached lazy priorities.
- Added constraint-safe mode for ApexSearch (future goal constraints, bounded
  single-agent horizon, time-zero constraints, reachability and deadlines).
- Added CLI integration, JSON path export, examples, validation and documentation.
- Updated portable CMake/compiler usage, strict comparison helpers, merge tie
  arithmetic, base-class destruction, and input error handling.
- Removed generated upstream build artifacts from the distributed source tree.

The baseline solver implementations remain available; the new algorithm is
implemented in pexHSolver.cpp and ConflictAnalysis.cpp rather than silently
replacing the original pexSolver run loop.
